<h2 id="spaces-groupoids-section-introduction" class="tex-section"><span data-tag="0438">78.1</span> Introduction</h2>

<p>
This chapter is devoted to generalities concerning groupoids in algebraic spaces. We recommend reading the beautiful paper <span class="cite">[<a href="/bibliography/K-M">K-M</a>]</span> by Keel and Mori. 
</p>
<p>
A lot of what we say here is a repeat of what we said in the chapter on groupoid schemes, see Groupoids, Section <a href="/tag/022M" data-tag="022M">39.1</a>. The discussion of quotient stacks is new here. 
</p>
